Package: blackboard-bus
Version: 1.1.0
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.9), adduser
Maintainer: SFDC24 <abdus@sfdc24.com>
Description: Self-hosted SFDC24 Blackboard bus
 Carries the Blackboard bus architecture on an Ubuntu VM (target:
 Google Cloud). Implements the v1 Apps Script bus contract
 (read/append/time + health) so existing fleet clients port by changing
 BUS_URL, adds the filed fixes (REPLACE, tail read, schema-aware append,
 honest HTTP status codes, write echoes), and ships the proposed
 LEDGER SCHEMA v1 event ledger (event/inbox/work with lease arithmetic,
 409 on conflicting claims, and durable per-claim fencing). Stdlib-only Python, SQLite storage,
 systemd service with hardening. Secret via environment only (D-18).
